  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Chloroflexus aurantiacus J-10-fl cells were cultured in “D” medium as reported previously (7) under anaerobic and semiaerobic growth conditions at 48°C in low-intensity light (6 W/m2)."
